  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JRPG.Core.ForestOpeningCutscene
  monologueLines:
  - Ugh... my head... what happened?
  - This is a forest. The last thing I remember is that strange light swallowing
    everything.
  - I still have my sword... but where is everyone else?
  - I need to find a way out. I hope the others made it too.
